  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_8070.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) El grup de hardcorepunk &#39;Santa Matanza&#39; ha presentat aquest cap de setmana al Casal Popular d&#39;Onda el seu disc &#39;La Patrulla Can&iacute;bal&#39;, despr&eacute;s</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_3612.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>d&#39;haver gravat dissabte 2 de desembre&nbsp;un videoclip amb una can&ccedil;&oacute; contra el &#39;bullying&#39; o assetjament escolar, al centre de formaci&oacute; de persones adultes L&#39;Aladern i a la pista poliesportiva del Raval del Castell.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3610.jpg\" alt=\"img_3610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3611.jpg\" alt=\"img_3611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3612.jpg\" alt=\"img_3612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3613.jpg\" alt=\"img_3613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3614.jpg\" alt=\"img_3614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3616.jpg\" alt=\"img_3616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santamatanzavideoclipconcert/img_3618.jpg\" alt=\"img_3618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img